{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35339","headline":"华山 · 张乔","name":"华山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青苍河一隅，气状杳难图。\n卓杰三峰出，高奇四岳无。\n力疑擎上界，势独压中区。\n衆水东西走，羣山远近趋。\n天回诸宿照，地耸百灵扶。\n石壁烟霞丽，龙潭雨雹麤。\n澄凝临甸服，险固束神都。\n浅觉川原异，深应日月殊。\n鹤归青霭合，仙去白云孤。\n瀑漏斜飞冻，松长倒挂枯。\n每来寻洞穴，不拟返江湖。\n傥有芝田种，岩间老一夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}